#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/L11rcases2or.lean:13
msgid "# Advanced Tutorial World\n"
"\n"
"## The §0 tactic (II)\n"
"\n"
"Now suppose your hypothesis says that §1 or §2 holds, that is, §3. Then §4 (same tactic as before, now applied to an *or* instead of an *and*) creates\n"
"two goals. In the first, §5 is replaced with §6, and in the second with §7.\n"
"\n"
"You may need to remember how §8 works. If the goal is\n"
"§9, then §10 (where §11 is some point that you know lies on ℓ) turns\n"
"the goal into §12. The point you need is either in the *Theorems* section or among the hypotheses\n"
"above the goal.\n"
"[**Reminder:** when the goal splits in two, handle each one on its own line starting with §13\n"
"(typed §14), like §15 and then §16.]"
msgstr ""

