#: Game/TacticDoc.lean:160
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"If the goal is §0 or §1, §2 breaks it into two goals.\n"
"\n"
"## Details\n"
"\n"
"If §3 and the goal is §4, then §5 gives you\n"
"two goals: §6 and §7.\n"
"\n"
"If the goal is §8, you get §9 and §10.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If your local context (the top right box) looks like this\n"
"§11\n"
"\n"
"then after §12 it will look like this:\n"
"\n"
"§13\n"
"\n"
"### Working on one goal at a time\n"
"When you have several goals, it keeps things tidy to focus on one at a time\n"
"with a bullet §14 (type it with §15). Like so:\n"
"§16\n"
"Here §17 and §18 work on the first goal, and §19 and §20 on the second.\n"
"Each bullet has to finish its goal completely. Line up the tactics under the first one\n"
"after the bullet. Bullets work after any tactic that creates several goals\n"
"(like §21, §22 on an §23, or §24)."
msgstr ""

