#: Game/TacticDoc.lean:91
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"If the goal is §0, then §1 closes it exactly when\n"
"§2 is a term of type §3 (a proof of §4).\n"
"\n"
"## Details\n"
"\n"
"Say §5, §6 and §7 are types (think of them as sets or as\n"
"propositions), and your local context looks like this:\n"
"\n"
"§8\n"
"\n"
"If you can spot how to build a term of type §9, just\n"
"write it down after §10 and you're done. For example, the\n"
"goal above can be solved with\n"
"\n"
"§11\n"
"\n"
"because §12 has type §13, and then §14 has type §15.\n"
"(That's an element of the set §16, or a proof of the proposition §17.)"
msgstr ""

