#: Game/TacticDoc.lean:405
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"If §0 is a hypothesis, and the goal is §1 then\n"
"§2 changes the goal to §3.\n"
"\n"
"## Details\n"
"\n"
"If you have §4 and your goal is §5,\n"
"then §6 changes the goal to §7. The idea is\n"
"simple: you want a term of type §8, and §9 turns terms of\n"
"type §10 into terms of type §11, so it's enough to build a term of type §12.\n"
"In words: \"we need to prove §13, but we know §14,\n"
"so it's enough to prove §15\"."
msgstr ""

