#: Game/TacticDoc.lean:453
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"Proof by contradiction. It changes the goal from §0 to §1 and adds\n"
"a new hypothesis §2 to your local context.\n"
"\n"
"## Real Life Example\n"
"\n"
"Say you want to prove §3, and you know §4.\n"
"Type §5 to add §6 to your context and change the\n"
"goal into §7. Then use §8 and §9 to find the contradiction."
msgstr ""

