#: Game/TacticDoc.lean:389
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"Splits your proof into two cases: a statement is true, or it's false.\n"
"\n"
"## Details\n"
"\n"
"Suppose you want to prove a statement §0, where §1\n"
"is a number. Maybe you know how to do it when §2,\n"
"and a different way when §3.\n"
"Then §4 gives you\n"
"two goals: the first has §5 in the context\n"
"and the second has §6."
msgstr ""

