#: Game/Levels/IncidenceWorld/level08.lean:13
msgid "We finish this world by proving that triangles exist. Almost there!\n"
"\n"
"Some Lean tips to help you along:\n"
"\n"
"**Tip 1:** Whenever a hypothesis looks like §0, you can refer to §1 and §2 as §3 and §4, respectively.\n"
"\n"
"**Tip 2:** Whenever your goal looks like §5, the §6 tactic will make progress.\n"
"\n"
"**Strategy:** Take non-collinear points §7 and the three lines §8, §9, §10. A point §11 on all three would have to be §12\n"
"(the only common point of §13 and §14), but §15 is not on §16. For this you first need §17;\n"
"the theorem §18 helps to prove that, and §19 (see the *Theorems* tab)\n"
"says two different lines share at most one point.\n"
"\n"
"§20\n"
"\n"
"If you get stuck, go back to the previous levels to remember how the tactics work. Good luck, let's do this!"
msgstr ""

